rcise by Board of functions transferred to them</a></p><ol><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1999/2/section/3">3.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1999/2/section/3"> General functions of Board.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1999/2/section/4">4.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1999/2/section/4">Recovery of contributions where income tax recovery provisions not applicable.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1999/2/section/5">5.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1999/2/section/5"> Powers relating to enforcement.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1999/2/section/6">6.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1999/2/section/6"> Disclosure of information.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1999/2/section/7">7.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1999/2/section/7"> Use of information by Board.</a></span></p></li></ol></li></ol></li><li class="LegClearFix LegContentsPart tocDefaultExpanded   "><p class="LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1999/2/part/II">Part II Decisions and appeals</a></p><ol><li class="LegContentsEntry LegConfersPower"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1999/2/section/8">8.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1999/2/section/8">Decisions by officers of Board.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry LegConfersPower"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearF